Graphwar local game
===================

Start server + client:
npm run dev

Open two or more browser tabs:
http://localhost:5173/?guild=local-guild&user=alice
http://localhost:5173/?guild=local-guild&user=bob
http://localhost:5173/?guild=local-guild&user=charlie

Optional avatar URL example:
http://localhost:5173/?guild=local-guild&user=alice&displayName=Alice&avatar=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.example%2Falice.png

Flow:
1. Alice creates a lobby from the main menu.
2. Bob opens the second tab, joins Alice's lobby, picks an alias/color, and joins a team or player slot.
3. Alice starts the match from the lobby setup screen.


Map maker
=========

Build and launch in one command:
npm run dev:map-maker

Alternative explicit commands:
npm --workspace apps/map-maker run build
npm --workspace apps/map-maker run start


Verification commands
=====================

Run unit/integration tests:
npm test

Run typecheck:
npm run check

Run browser e2e tests:
npm run test:e2e

Build map maker:
npm run build:map-maker
